window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Not all who live behind bars are guilty, and some who roam free prey, lurk, and prowl…</b></p> <p>Having returned from a successful case among the mountains of Idaho, FBI Agent Allie Bishop is sent undercover to investigate strange happenings in a local prison. Inmates are going missing upon their release, and some are turning up dead.</p> <p>Meanwhile, someone remains intent on seeing Allie dead, and any answers surrounding her mother's disappearance continue to elude her grasp.</p> <p><i>Don't miss the next thrilling installment in the celebrated Allie Bishop FBI Mystery Thriller series.</i></p>"; 
